# Auto reload

After changing `androidApp/`, `shared/src/`, or `iosApp/Metrom/` sources, do not wait for a manual install.

A Cursor hook queues `scripts/dev-reload-queue.sh`, which debounces 3s then runs `scripts/dev-reload.sh` (Android `installDebug` + relaunch, iOS `xcodebuild` + simctl relaunch). A file watcher covers editor saves.

- Do not also spawn a second Gradle/Xcode install in the same turn unless the hook/watcher is clearly dead.
- If you need an immediate reload, run `scripts/dev-reload-queue.sh` once at the end of the turn and return.
- Skip Garmin. Skip reload for markdown, build outputs, and `.xcuserstate`.
- Logs: `/tmp/metrom-reload.log`
